      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15697c4fd9ec4db8efaadbff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天才魔法少女Sweepy\r\n无论何时都会获胜！\r\n先准备好帮我庆祝吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2bc646223a8506da70ad44d527d7502eb7c54e2e306ad78ba37ebaca3ebb18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea5f0169a56df9eaed8b0d64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，感觉真不错♪\r\n今天应该能使出厉害的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc7e509cfd8b4ebffb3a0a0ffe07c7cce44189d578d923499ea1b7426a97b28c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23360a781a50b2934f20841f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现得还不错嘛。辛苦你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb179944787bcbfec36de06077db30b20d1cd499ca67b3d6c60820b414fa702",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a2cc722617af18046b05f10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30018edfb0c3e6d25822efc176770762d5cfe5ec512b78949f6d10d3a4aee7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:becc342d4f09609b090f6c37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌～！\r\n我下次会拿下第一名～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f53c8171fdbf84bdc8e77bb996404679bbf819d1ed443542b41f54689546794",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e3d5b1e13fa80838ad0886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才不会这样就满意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07da77933efeb1c5ba93f8b7142a2e1248ecf1cba4b09ebd1b20d393301f0795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5b54f6919f4540de4f20e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是今天状况不太好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a53d5024c589525144dc9938a574072cb12eb4c076930302d2211548dec14f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62bbb25871b6fe405c53336d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌讨厌！\r\n重新再比一次啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c35bd2aea59ee2f2bf330a633458642211a8a686d65cc8dc209b5cc860dabf6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e48f1b76687b658ac440634",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼！\r\n知道魔女的厉害了吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b22def3a0b78b89eefa49244e62d13f1ab1915d3cd9371b41a48d40dccd0a30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ff3270d9c544283270d7d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，我的表现就像魔法一样吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a22f98ff4ed67de8df193cae3aadb3e0c4eca8189f88ddca3cc0fa3a92641b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:272291b63a5fecd82f26fd28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふん♪まだ、魔法はないって言う？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ea64091c685c5fc4c7b471899a54183cc3533bf1e6457cd3602a4d1013ef5c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f31dff97ac72883f9e18d79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふんっ、マジカルな走りだったでしょ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf2e173c54a9839eae41ddd545e69dcae8dc559898108fbfe4b80735a7062785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:835ed5ced4e9ee43397a6025",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上场啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3861f23a8a98d8b04faafc68d69d8eec7e3747c08ef2c4efd43811a2aa11bd00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5fd0d60ef5c136efd9fcec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰，魔力全开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78647b5f0b830873b68407e403498de7a1a58c87de81fef64e8e5ea7193a0c4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5736b8ac2606c0e8859f38d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸一直问我哪天回老家，\r\n真的超啰嗦的！总之，\r\n等年假放完我就会回去看他了啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9516d3074a3a1bfb07f2eaaa40c0795f2b3d43c322dfc4d1b946c388c793a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:620f14bff0590299c3a76957",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的，每件事都要我费心。\r\n看来除了准备过新年外，\r\n还有很多事情需要我来施魔法呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5ce41ff741f1a19286440bcf192874547d3b3fc1c7f801fe068b2b545c0ce84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b9e53df05b8eb4d6bcf31f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞厅里那颗闪亮亮的球，\r\n感觉起来好像有点魔力呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "789dc941ef4c0f280e0197d326dc50cee60f742fedf809708accc5b1da2b8501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e570057acea0206a8b7c0ce0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どう！？アンタも\r\n使いたくなったんじゃない？\r\n特別な、ワクワクする魔法を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a4596d4953c5251a7f1dacb14e764c76d472c6f8d95a80f0bfd9bd27257289f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c06c56b7eb98f4956eff19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶……☆\r\n让大家见识最棒的魔法！\r\n乖乖听话啊！嗯……做好觉悟吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3168b117ebd1550fe6d01dfcb9947eb75c02af5ad04a5bffeec766ccdae41f30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d36504f80b1ec914e0a0f21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新しい魔女服、\r\nグランマにい～っぱい\r\nほめてもらうんだから♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cf36a96355a0818e0663032fa9e436c2cf2b4c2257899163fb9a6f3629c9e0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c0bc57e4b12a90cfde9ec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动结束啦？是喔。\r\n是说我应该要来去找祖母，\r\n让她教我怎么用那个魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e2a20171ee57b32d9981c52a3a6150c8d2952aa7f1415b8f166124a8d594c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
